[h2]Build 0.9.3[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Planted crops now report their real growth rate, so mods and buildings that speed up or slow down growth (fertilizer, growth boosters and the like) are counted, in the year view too. Zones not planted yet are assumed to grow like the planted ones.
[*]Noxious haze and drought now count while they last.
[*]The notes column shows when growth is boosted or slowed, and by how much.
[/list]
